ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 35153, Dec. 31, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 3, 2025.
Article 2 (Special cases concerning formulation of master plan and action plan)
(1) Notwithstanding Article 3 (1), the first master plan to be formulated after this Decree enters into force shall be formulated by June 30, 2026.
(2) Notwithstanding Article 3 (3), the first action plan to be formulated after this Decree enters into force shall be formulated by December 31, 2026.
